<title>FRANCE: Malta buys 6,000 tns optional feed barley - trader.</title>
<headline>Malta buys 6,000 tns optional feed barley - trader.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malta has bought 6,000 tonnes of optional-origin feed barley for March shipment at $142.50 per tonne, including cost and freight, European grain traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
